+## CI #42446206797 — Windows Server ancestry and explicit private staging
+
+Boss authorized diagnosis, implementation and complete available native qualification
+of the two remaining Windows process failures in
+[this diagnostic run](https://github.com/Shmellyorc/Void.Language/actions/runs/42446206797).
+The original working tree was clean at the stated baseline. The existing
+installation correction, LLVM 23.1.4 selectors, approved libsodium backport,
+provider recipes, pins, receipts and corresponding-source packaging are retained.
+No staging, commit, branch, history change, push, hosted dispatch, provider/LLVM installation, dependency pin change
